Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.70,0:01:05.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  跳伞学员们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.70,0:01:05.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, skydiving students
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.86,0:01:07.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,仔细听好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.86,0:01:07.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,listen carefully
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要你们听从我的指示
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need you to follow my instructions
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.98,0:01:11.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后才可以跳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.98,0:01:11.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,before you dive
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.11,0:01:13.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他刚刚说跳吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.11,0:01:13.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did he say "dive"?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.92,0:01:16.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  他说的是跳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.92,0:01:16.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, he said "dive"
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.82,0:01:18.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们跳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.82,0:01:18.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's dive
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.07,0:01:19.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.07,0:01:19.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dive
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.75,0:01:27.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们的降落伞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.75,0:01:27.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your parachutes
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.49,0:01:30.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尽量落在软的东西上面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.49,0:01:30.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Try to fall on something soft
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.62,0:01:32.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.62,0:01:32.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.86,0:01:35.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跳伞课快迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.86,0:01:35.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am late for my skydiving lesson
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.86,0:01:36.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.86,0:01:36.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me too
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.91,0:01:39.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我还是好困
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.91,0:01:39.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I'm still sleepy
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.27,0:01:44.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再睡几分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.27,0:01:44.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just a few minutes
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.21,0:01:48.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,五小时后
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.95,0:01:52.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,地面越来越近了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.95,0:01:52.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The ground is getting closer
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.97,0:01:54.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,教练之前说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.97,0:01:54.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What did the instructor say?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.01,0:01:57.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,落在软的东西上面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.01,0:01:57.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fall on something soft
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.88,0:01:59.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我看到软的东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.88,0:01:59.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I see something soft
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.68,0:02:01.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就在我们正下面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.68,0:02:01.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right below us
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.10,0:02:12.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跳伞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.10,0:02:12.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Skydiving
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.07,0:02:14.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你帮忙  海霸王
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:14.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the assist, Bubble Bass
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.78,0:02:20.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那这里是什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.78,0:02:20.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So, what is this place?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.63,0:02:23.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是夜校
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.63,0:02:23.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's night school
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.95,0:02:26.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么会有人大晚上的来上学呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.95,0:02:26.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why would anyone go to school at night?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.53,0:02:28.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,黑不溜秋的  什么都看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.53,0:02:28.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It would be too dark to see anything
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.63,0:02:33.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,学校里可能有荧光老师吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.63,0:02:33.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They probably have glow-in-the-dark teachers
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.98,0:02:38.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.98,0:02:38.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Idiots
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.23,0:02:43.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,夜校是大人们提升自己水平的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.23,0:02:43.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Night school is where adults go to better themselves
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.77,0:02:48.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有什么好提升的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.77,0:02:48.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like we could get any better
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.27,0:02:48.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.27,0:02:48.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.87,0:02:50.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们几乎可完美了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.87,0:02:50.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're practically perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.29,0:02:58.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过我们还是可以比完美更完美
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.29,0:02:58.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But we can always get better than perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.49,0:02:59.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去上学吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.49,0:02:59.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go to school
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.70,0:03:02.78,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(492,290)}爵士
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.83,0:03:06.24,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(992,284)}海草编织
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.40,0:03:09.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该上哪门课呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:09.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Which class should we take?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.04,0:03:11.83,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1368,292)}精神病学
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.73,0:03:11.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,神经病学
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.73,0:03:11.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Puh-si-chi-uh-tree"?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.51,0:03:15.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟我说说看你们的母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.51,0:03:15.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tell me about your mothers
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.95,0:03:19.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不上  我们太理智了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.95,0:03:19.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nah, we're too well-adjusted
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.51,0:03:20.93,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1460,312)}标本剥制
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.72,0:03:20.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要不来上标本剥制
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.72,0:03:20.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe taxidermy?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.97,0:03:25.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,同学们  接下来讲标本填充这一步
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:25.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, class, let's move on to stuffing
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.79,0:03:28.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我喜欢拿肉汁填饱肚子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.79,0:03:28.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I like stuffing with gravy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:31.94,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(958,448)}超现实主义
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.10,0:03:31.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,超现实主义呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:31.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How about surrealism?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.52,0:03:36.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不合逻辑方为崇高
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.52,0:03:36.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The illogical is the sublime
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.98,0:03:38.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,同意到不能再同意了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:38.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Couldn't agree more
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.19,0:03:43.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我拿不定主意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.19,0:03:43.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't decide
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.00,0:03:47.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来做侧手翻  撞到哪门上哪门
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:45.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll just do cartwheels
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.07,0:03:47.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and pick the next class I crash into
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.87,0:03:53.62,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1044,560)}可乐那语基础
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.80,0:03:53.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可乐那语基础
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.80,0:03:53.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Klopnodian 101"
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.57,0:03:56.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你妈是可乐那人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.57,0:03:56.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your mom's from Klopnod
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.44,0:03:58.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她会怎么说  来上这门课
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.44,0:03:58.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How would she say, "Let's take this class"?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.68,0:04:02.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用嘴巴说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.68,0:04:02.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With her mouth, probably
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.67,0:04:06.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有股芜菁味
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.67,0:04:06.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Smells like turnips
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.64,0:04:10.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都坐好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:10.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everybody, sit
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.60,0:04:18.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可乐那语是全海洋最老最复杂的语言
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.60,0:04:15.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Klopnodian is oldest
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.31,0:04:18.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and most sophisticated language in ocean
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.02,0:04:22.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来示范怎么说  早安
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:22.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I demonstrate saying, "Good morning"
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.10,0:04:25.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,巴拉趴打趴服陆斯诺一可
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.10,0:04:25.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Brappa-dappa floop-snoik
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.60,0:04:26.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.60,0:04:26.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, you try
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.07,0:04:27.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.07,0:04:27.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.47,0:04:31.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哇啪哇啪哼哼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:31.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Whappa whappa oink
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.47,0:04:33.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哈趴打趴陆普诺一可
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.47,0:04:33.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Happa-dappa loop noink?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.70,0:04:36.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,死拿啪哼破一颗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.70,0:04:36.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Snappa-hoink ploink?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.79,0:04:37.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实那不是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.79,0:04:37.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Actually, that's not--
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.43,0:04:39.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟着我念
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.43,0:04:39.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Repeat with me
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.74,0:04:43.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拍啊钉卡哞派
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.74,0:04:43.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Slap-a dinka moo-pie
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.22,0:04:44.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,陆啪死努咔飞啊飞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:44.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Loopa-snooka fly-by
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.21,0:04:44.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,停
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.21,0:04:44.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stop
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.63,0:04:45.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,住口
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.63,0:04:45.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Halt
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.65,0:04:46.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别念了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.65,0:04:46.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Finish
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.47,0:04:49.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们侮辱了母语
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.47,0:04:49.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You are mocking the mother tongue
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.47,0:04:49.47,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1162,920)}舌
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.87,0:04:51.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起  母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.87,0:04:51.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mother
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.75,0:05:01.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那门课通过了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.75,0:05:01.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We passed that class
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.91,0:05:03.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们提升了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.91,0:05:03.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're bettering
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.47,0:05:06.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个不许动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.47,0:05:06.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there, you two
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.61,0:05:09.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走廊通行证呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.61,0:05:09.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are your hall passes?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.04,0:05:12.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:12.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's he saying?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.67,0:05:14.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他想知道你头盔上面的HM
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.67,0:05:14.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He wants to know if the HM on your helmet
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.89,0:05:17.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,意思是不是河马肉丸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.89,0:05:17.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,stands for Hippopotamus Meatballs
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.42,0:05:22.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它意思正是督导队员
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.42,0:05:22.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It happens to stand for Hall Monitor
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.35,0:05:24.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个还是这里的学生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.35,0:05:24.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you two even students?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.85,0:05:25.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们当然是了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.85,0:05:25.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure, we are
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.84,0:05:28.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚还通过了可乐那语基础呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.84,0:05:28.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We just passed Klopnodian 101
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.50,0:05:30.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们会说早安
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.50,0:05:30.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We can say "good morning"
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.00,0:05:33.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拍啊钉卡哞派
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:33.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Slap-a dinka moon-pie
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.77,0:05:35.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.77,0:05:35.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Watch it
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.36,0:05:43.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:43.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's asleep
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.73,0:05:45.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,毕竟是夜校嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.73,0:05:45.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, it is night school
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.01,0:05:47.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再上一门课吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.01,0:05:47.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's take another class
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.84,0:05:51.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们是来提升自己的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:51.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're here to better ourselves
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.47,0:05:53.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然我已经很完美了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.47,0:05:53.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Even though I'm perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.35,0:05:54.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哎哟喂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:54.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, well
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.42,0:05:56.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这不是屁股克星吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.42,0:05:56.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If it isn't the butt busters
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.23,0:05:58.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坐好不要吵
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.23,0:05:58.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sit down and be quiet
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.12,0:06:03.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎来上阿宅烹饪课
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.12,0:06:03.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Cooking for Nerds
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.25,0:06:06.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是你们的海霸王老师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.25,0:06:06.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am your teacher, Mr. Bass
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.95,0:06:12.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一般的平民百姓认为
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.95,0:06:12.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your average civilian believes
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.45,0:06:16.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加热食物需要烤面包机或者微波炉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:16.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that you need a toaster or a microwave to heat your food
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.68,0:06:18.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但阿宅知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:18.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But a nerd knows
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.42,0:06:22.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以把辣香肠卷放自己的肥肉里加热
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.42,0:06:20.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that you can heat your pepperoni rolls
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:22.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in your own rolls
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.65,0:06:25.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要肥肉能提供足够的热量即可
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.65,0:06:25.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,providing they give off sufficient heat
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.51,0:06:36.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那吐司面包呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.51,0:06:36.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What about toast?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.30,0:06:40.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有最新的操作系统  最多五分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.30,0:06:40.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Five minutes tops with the latest operating system
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.17,0:06:43.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那这些漫画书呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.17,0:06:43.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What about these comic books?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.93,0:06:45.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以拿来烹饪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.93,0:06:45.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are they for cooking?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.05,0:06:46.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.05,0:06:46.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course not
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.51,0:06:49.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那些是吃完饭后拿来看的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:49.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They are for after-dinner reading
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.23,0:06:55.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,九九成新
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.23,0:06:55.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mint condition
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.23,0:06:55.63,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1058,920)}薄荷
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.63,0:06:56.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,薄荷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.63,0:06:56.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mint?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.54,0:07:00.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有薄荷味
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:07:00.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Doesn't taste like mint
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.81,0:07:05.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,品质近乎九成新  带有一丝霉味
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.81,0:07:05.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Very fine to near mint with a hint of mold
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.23,0:07:08.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们干了什么好事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.23,0:07:08.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.82,0:07:12.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是在提升自己自己自己
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.82,0:07:12.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We just keep getting better-er-er
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.72,0:07:18.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个站住
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:18.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You two, stop
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.66,0:07:20.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走廊通行证呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.66,0:07:20.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where's your hall pass?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.38,0:07:23.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是河马肉丸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.38,0:07:23.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's Hippopotamus Meatballs
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.67,0:07:25.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下  我们没有走廊通行证
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:25.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, we don't have a hall pass
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.72,0:07:27.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好躲进男厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.72,0:07:27.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We better hide in the boys' room
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.87,0:07:34.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:34.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.82,0:07:36.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是夜校坏小子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.82,0:07:36.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Night school bad boys
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.76,0:07:38.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.76,0:07:38.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.02,0:07:41.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们就是坏小子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.02,0:07:41.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're bad boys
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.34,0:07:42.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有意见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.34,0:07:42.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got a problem with that?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.29,0:07:43.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:43.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.08,0:07:45.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们坏到了骨子里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.08,0:07:45.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're bad to the bone
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.03,0:07:47.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对吧  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.03,0:07:47.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right, SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.35,0:07:49.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.35,0:07:49.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.29,0:07:50.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.29,0:07:50.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,B-b-b-b-bad
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.52,0:07:53.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来看看有多坏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.52,0:07:53.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's see how bad
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.03,0:08:05.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,换你们吹
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.03,0:08:05.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, you blow
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.48,0:08:07.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是牌子上写不准吹泡泡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.48,0:08:07.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But the sign says no bubble blowing
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.37,0:08:12.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个是胆小鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.37,0:08:12.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you two, yellow?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.37,0:08:12.27,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1094,920)}黄 色
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.12,0:08:15.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:15.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.00,0:08:15.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不黄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.00,0:08:15.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.19,0:08:17.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吹啊  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.19,0:08:17.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.60,0:08:18.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给他们瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.60,0:08:18.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Show 'em
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.21,0:08:24.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.21,0:08:24.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's me
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.12,0:08:25.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.12,0:08:25.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sweet
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.52,0:08:30.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,超级酷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.52,0:08:30.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Super cool
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.16,0:08:33.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.16,0:08:33.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look at that
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.42,0:08:35.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太神了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.42,0:08:35.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Amazing
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.30,0:08:40.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.30,0:08:40.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Someone's coming
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.35,0:08:42.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.35,0:08:42.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's scram
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.52,0:08:44.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坏小子一辈子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.52,0:08:44.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bad boys forever
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.70,0:08:57.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.70,0:08:57.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Alright, come out of there
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.65,0:08:58.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.65,0:08:58.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.36,0:09:01.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在老师上厕所要限时吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.36,0:09:01.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is there a time limit on the toilet now for teachers?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.16,0:09:03.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  章鱼哥老师
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.16,0:09:03.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Mr. Tentacles
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.88,0:09:06.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是在找两个吹泡泡的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.88,0:09:06.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was just looking for a couple of bubble blowers
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.59,0:09:07.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们没走廊通行证
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.59,0:09:07.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,without a hall pass
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.90,0:09:09.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没走廊通行证吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:09.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No hall pass?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.13,0:09:12.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不可原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.13,0:09:12.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Inexcusable
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.50,0:09:16.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,与你共事很荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.50,0:09:16.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's been fun
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.10,0:09:21.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,同学们晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.10,0:09:21.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good evening, class
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.45,0:09:23.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎来上批判性思维课
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.45,0:09:23.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and welcome to Critical Thinking
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.23,0:09:27.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是你们的老师  章鱼哥教授
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.23,0:09:27.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm your teacher, Professor Tentacles
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.17,0:09:29.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥老师晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.17,0:09:29.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good evening, Professor Tentacles
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.87,0:09:30.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.87,0:09:30.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You two?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.33,0:09:35.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的书怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.33,0:09:35.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What happened to my books?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.51,0:09:36.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.51,0:09:36.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick got hungry
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.90,0:09:39.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,连九成新都不是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.90,0:09:39.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They weren't even near mint
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.05,0:09:40.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坐好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.05,0:09:40.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sit down
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.56,0:09:45.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们问什么是批判性思维
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.56,0:09:45.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is critical thinking, you ask?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.45,0:09:48.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来以批判做出演示
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.45,0:09:48.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll demonstrate by being critical
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.33,0:09:52.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你  样子活像个巨婴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.33,0:09:52.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You, you look like a big baby
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.20,0:10:00.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你  早就彻底过时了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:10:00.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You, you're completely out of fashion
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.55,0:10:05.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.55,0:10:05.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And you
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.42,0:10:09.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.42,0:10:09.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob SquarePants
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.64,0:10:11.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,同学们记笔记
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.64,0:10:11.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take notes, class
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.63,0:10:15.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给大家瞧瞧真正的批判
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.63,0:10:15.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now you'll see some real criticism
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.61,0:10:17.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是个过度活跃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.61,0:10:17.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're a hyperactive
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.63,0:10:21.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不切实际  总爱夸张
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.63,0:10:21.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,unrealistic, over-expressive
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.29,0:10:23.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又幼稚的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.29,0:10:23.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,naive child
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.53,0:10:30.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,长得像块便宜奶酪  智商却像块砖头
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.53,0:10:26.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with the looks of budget cheese
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.35,0:10:30.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and the intellect of a brick
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.05,0:10:32.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的笑声还很烦人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.05,0:10:32.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And you have an annoying laugh
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.07,0:10:35.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太对了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.07,0:10:35.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So true
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.35,0:10:37.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的鼻子也很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.35,0:10:37.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And you have an adorable nose
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.58,0:10:45.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别批判我了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:45.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stop criticizing me
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.30,0:10:47.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下课
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.30,0:10:47.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Class dismissed
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.64,0:10:51.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,批判性思维  完美过关
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.64,0:10:51.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Critical thinking, aced it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.61,0:10:54.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥忘带走廊通行证了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.61,0:10:54.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward forgot his hall pass
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.45,0:10:55.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  拿点通行证
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.45,0:10:55.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, grab some passes
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.35,0:10:57.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.35,0:10:57.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.91,0:10:58.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.91,0:10:58.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.14,0:10:59.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.14,0:10:59.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.58,0:11:00.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.58,0:11:00.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.49,0:11:00.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.49,0:11:00.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 3,0:11:00.94,0:11:01.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 2,0:11:00.94,0:11:01.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Halt
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.10,0:11:05.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,逮到你们两个没通行证在走廊乱逛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:05.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I caught you two in the hall without a pass
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.57,0:11:06.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一犯再犯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.57,0:11:06.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Again
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.07,0:11:09.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给他瞧瞧我们的通行证  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.07,0:11:09.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Show him our passes, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.60,0:11:11.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  不要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:11.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, no
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.47,0:11:12.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吐出来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.47,0:11:12.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Spit those out
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.52,0:11:33.79,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1304,218)}出口
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.54,0:11:15.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我投降
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.54,0:11:15.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I give up
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.90,0:11:17.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们可以通行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.90,0:11:17.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can pass
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.52,0:11:19.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,告辞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.52,0:11:19.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take leave
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.45,0:11:22.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,勇往直前  成长开窍
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.45,0:11:22.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go forth and thrive
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.46,0:11:24.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他刚刚说要开跳吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.46,0:11:24.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did he say "dive"?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.37,0:11:27.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  他说跳
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.37,0:11:27.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, he said "dive"
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.44,0:11:29.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就跳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.44,0:11:29.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then, let's dive
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.10,0:11:33.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们忘带降落伞了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.10,0:11:33.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You forgot your parachutes
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.81,0:11:38.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们说怎么样  兄弟们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.81,0:11:38.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you say, fellas?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.38,0:11:42.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坏小子一辈子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:42.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bad boys forever
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.09,0:11:46.68,起司 一般标题,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H00FFC1&}受雇之痛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.89,0:11:48.06,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(752,430)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.89,0:11:48.06,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(770,722)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.89,0:11:52.44,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1530,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:49.52,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(636,484)}指导总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:49.52,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(800,700)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.81,0:11:50.98,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(760,550)}制片
